# Prompts for this use case live here as one *.prompt.yaml file per prompt.
# Generate them via COPILOT_PROMPTS.md (or python ../../copilot_prompts.py --usecase <name>).
# Each file: id, version, labels, model_alias, temperature, inputs, template, eval_refs, changelog.
# This .gitkeep keeps the empty folder in Git until the first prompt is added.
